WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.600
It’s Monday, 9:07 AM. Forty-seven unread messages are waiting.

00:04.600 --> 00:07.800
The agent reconstructs the P1, its owner, resolution, and the runbook that lied.

00:07.800 --> 00:10.900
Search solves a five-month printer mystery in an ignored facilities message.

00:10.900 --> 00:14.000
Replies, reactions, and read-state changes stay behind approval gates.

00:14.000 --> 00:17.200
Chrome extraction, Keychain decryption, token refresh, and workspace profiles keep the local path alive.

00:17.200 --> 00:20.000
Forty-seven unreads become one brief, then zero after approval.
